Ima
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 5 DEAL APA
APA 7 FACE_HALF
APA 6 FACE_HALF
APA 4 FACE_HALF
APA 7 FACE_ALL
APA 6 FACE_ALL
APA 9 FACE_ALL
APA 8 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE APA APA
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
    DEST Size >= 9
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL APA Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
